  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <lg xml:id="TolC085">
          <l>ciṉainilaik kiḷavik kaiyuṅ kaṇṇum</l>
	        <l>viṉainilai yokku meṉmaṉār pulavar.</l>
        </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Iḷampūraṇar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Namaccivāya Mutaliyār</persName> 1931, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZMelJhy.TVA_BOK_0007521/page/69/mode/1up">69</ref>.</p>
      <p>
ic cūttiram eṉṉutaliṟṟō veṉiṉ, ituvum iraṇṭāvataṉōṭu ēḻāvataṉ mayakkamē kūṟutal nutaliṟṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
urai: ciṉaipporuṭku iraṇṭām vēṟṟumaiyum ēḻām vēṟṟumaiyum otta kiḻamaiyavām eṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        varalāṟu: 
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Ilam-cit1">
       <l>kaṇṇaik kuttiṉār,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Ilam-cit2">
        <l>kaṇṇuṭ kuttiṉār</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa varum.
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n92/mode/1up">89</ref>.</p>
      <p>i-ḷ. ciṉaimēṉiṟkuñcolliṟku iraṇṭāvatum ēḻāvatum viṉainilaikkaṇ okkumeṉṟu colluvar pulavar. e-ṟu.</p> 
      <p>u-m.</p> 
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Cena-cit1">
      <l>kōṭṭaikkuṟaittāṉ;</l> 
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Cena-cit2">
      <l>kōṭṭiṉkaṭkuṟaittāṉ</l> 
      </lg>
      <p>eṉa varum.</p>
      <p>viṉaikkuṟippai nīkkutaṟku viṉaiyeṉṟār.</p>
      <p>viṉainilaiyokkumeṉṟārēṉum, pukaḻtal paḻittaleṉṉuntoṭakkattaṉavoḻittu mayaṅkutaṟkēṟkum aṟuttal kuṟaittaṉmutalāyiṉa viṉaiyē koḷḷappaṭum.</p>
      <p>iraṇṭāvataṉporuṭkaṇ eḻāvatu ceṉṟatāyiṉum, ciṟuvaraviṟṟaṉṟi iraṉṭāvatupōla eḻāvatu vaḻakkiṉ kaṭpayiṉṟu varutaliṉ, okkumeṉṟār; atu kāraṇattāl, 
        karumamallāccārccikkuñ ciṉaikkiḷavikkum eḻāvatu urimaiyuṭaitteṉa uṭaṉkūṟātu, vēṟu kūṟiṉāreṉpatu.</p> 
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Nacciṉārkkiṉiyar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Irāma. Kōvintacāmipiḷḷai</persName> 1997, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZM3kZpy.TVA_BOK_0008472/page/n138/mode/1up">110</ref>.</p>
      <p>
ituvum atu
      </p>
      <lg>
        <l>ciṉai nilaik kiḷavik kaiyuṅ kaṇṇum</l>
        <l>viṉai nilai yokku meṉmaṉār pulavar.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
ituvu mavviraṇṭaṉ mayakkaṅ kūṟukiṉṟatu.
      </p>
      <p>
(i-ḷ) ciṉainilaik kiḷavikku ― ciṉaipporuṇ mēṉiṟkuñ colliṟku, aiyuṅkaṇṇum viṉainilai yokku meṉmaṉār pulavar – iraṇṭāvatu mēḻāvatum viṉaikūṟum nilaimaikka ṇokku meṉṟu kūṟuvar pulavareṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
(u-m)
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Nacc-cit1">
       <l>kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Nacc-cit2">
       <l>kōṭṭiṉkaṇ kuṟaittāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉavarum.
      </p>
      <p>
aṟuttal kuṟaittaṉ mutaliya viraṇṭāvataṉ poruḷkaṇēḻāvatu vantatēṉum, vaḻakkuppayiṟci nōkki, viṉainilai yokku meṉṟār. <num xml:lang="en">(2)</num>
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Teyvaccilaiyār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">1929, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n78/mode/1up">71</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n79/mode/1up">72</ref>.</p>
    </body>
    <p>
      ituvum atu.
    </p>
    <p>
      i-ḷ:― ciṉaip poruṇmaikkaṇ niṟkum peyarkkum iraṇṭāvatum ēḻāvatum viṉainilaikkaṇ otta iyalpiṉa. e-ṟu.
    </p>
    <p>
      u-m:―
    </p>
    <lg xml:id="TolC085-Tey-cit1">
      <l>kaṇṇaik kuttiṉāṉ.</l>
    </lg>
    <lg xml:id="TolC085-Tey-cit2">
      <l>kaṇṇuṭ kuttiṉāṉ</l>
    </lg>
    <p>
eṉavarum. kaṇ eṉpatu kuttappaṭu poruḷumākik kuttutaṟku iṭamum āki varutaliṉ, iraṇṭaṟkum otta iyalpiṉa āyiṉa. iṭam āyiṉavāṟu eṉṉai yeṉiṉ, kaṇṇiṉ kaṇṇum kuttappaṭuvatu ōr iṭam ākaliṉ eṉka. <hi rend="bold">viṉainilai okkum</hi> eṉṟār āyiṉum okkum viṉaiyē koḷḷappaṭum.	[2]
    </p>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Kallāṭaṉār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Cuntaramūrtti</persName> 1964, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/82/mode/1up">82</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/83/mode/1up">83</ref>.</p>
      <p>
eṉ - eṉiṉ, ituvum avviraṇṭaṉ mayakkamē uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        (i-ḷ.) ciṉaiyākiya nilaimaiyaiyuṭaiya poruṇmaikku iraṇṭāvatum ēḻāvatum ataṉ viṉaikkūṟu nilaimaikkaṇ otta poruḷ eṉṟu kūṟuvar pulavar, (e-ṟu.)
      </p>
      <p>
        (e-ṭu.) 
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Kal-cit1">
        <l>kaṇṇaikkuttiṉāṉ,</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC085-Kal-cit2">
        <l>kaṇṇiṉkaṇ kuttiṉāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa varum.
      </p>
      <p>
ciṉaikkaṇ ivviraṇṭum varum eṉṟatu eṉṉai, piṟavum varumāl eṉiṉ, muṉ iṭapporuṭkaṇ varum eṉṟa ēḻāvatu, maṟṟoru vēṟṟumaiyōṭu toṭarntu kūṟumvaḻic ceyappaṭuporuṭkaṇ varutalum kaṇṭu atu kūṟiyavāṟu eṉak koḷka. toṭarntu kūṟum vaḻiyāmāṟu uṇarac collukiṉṟār. viṉainilai eṉṟatu iraṇṭāvataṟku ōtiya viṉai, viṉaikkuṟippu eṉa uṇarka.	(2)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
